{'symbol': 'SPG', 'date': '2019-10-28 22:30:00', 'title': 'Soho House Limited announced that it has received £78 million in funding from Raycliff Capital, Simon Property Group, Inc.', 'text': 'Soho House Limited announced that it has received £78 million in funding on October 28, 2019. The company issued common shares in the transaction. The transaction included participation from new investors Raycliff Capital and Simon Property Group, Inc. (NYSE:SPG). The investors acquired 5% stake in the company through this transaction. The transaction brings the post money valuation of the company to £1,600 million.'}
